                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Not a bad game, but not a great one either. It utilizes the same engine as Castle Miner Z, its predecesor, so don't expect movement to be great. It's very slidey and hard to hit people in close quarters. The bullet mechanics are the same, as there is some bullet travel.\n\nOne thing I think would make this game a lot more playable would be the ability to rebind controls, and possibly add a crouch feature.\n\nFor $1, you're not really getting ripped off. This game definitely isn't for everyone, but if you liked Castle Miner z, I'd give it a go just for kicks. 6.5/10.",
